            <p>The Grand Canyon is among the most familiar natural subjects in the United States, which boasts of its colossal magnitude, stratified rocks, and stunning views. Tourists come to visit this attraction site in order to carry out sightseeing, photography, hiking, and learning activities. Getting to the region through rail routes is superior to the entire journey as people get to have a view of varying scenery even before they get there. </p>
