            <p>Scenery is also one of the characteristic benefits of rail travel. Travelling by train to the areas of the Grand Canyon, one can see desert and plateaus, forests and open wide skies. This progressive change creates suspense and changes the time spent traveling into an evocative and memorable experience. </p>

