            <p>Sitting comfortably is easier now on rail trips thanks to seats designed for longer rides. Long journeys aren’t a worry since toilets are there. Temperature stays fixed inside private compartments regardless of outside weather. Meals come straight to your spot. Many routes offer electric outlets near each chair. Internet access runs smoothly across most lines, helping pass time with tasks or videos alike. These will be useful in long and short rail journeys. </p>

